note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL
                    27–14 VIET/MARIGOLD. Top Secret; Immediate;
                        Nodis; Marigold. The source text does not indicate a time of transmission;
                    the telegram was received at 10:43 a.m. Printed in part in Herring, Secret Diplomacy of the Vietnam War, pp.
                    275–277.
